average of 34.9% for the past four auctions. The direct bid, a category of bids from non-primary dealers, banks, money managers and depository institutions who have direct accounts to submit bids to the Treasury auctions, was 11%, compared to the average of 15.5% for the past four auctions. (min.zeng@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 1702 GMT [Dow Jones] Treasury sold $36 bln two-year notes at a record low yield of 0.441%. It is the fifth month in a row the Treasury sells 2-yr debt with a record low rate. The yield compared with 0.443% just before the auction. The bid-to-cover ratio is 3.78, compared with the average of 3.21 from the past four auctions. (min.zeng@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 1658 GMT [Dow Jones] Shortly before $36 billion auction of two-year Treasurys at 1 p.m. EDT, the when-issued two-year note yielded 0.443% at 12:58 p.m. EDT, compared to the benchmark issue which yielded 0.428%. (min.zeng@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 1656 GMT [Dow Jones] Before 2-yr auction, 2-yr at 0.428%, 10-yr at 2.528%. Auction expected to go well, getting boost from Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 fx intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \uc2 Dan Greenhaus\uc2  of \uc2 Miller Tabak + Co\uc2 . says that "along with the fairly high probability of further Fed asset purchases, Treasury auctions are likely to be bolstered for the foreseeable future."\par \par \uc2 (deborah.blumberg@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 1635 GMT [Dow Jones] The weekend election in Venezuela has raised the prospects of democratic and peaceful transition from zero to possible, and this should result in higher asset prices, said \uc2 Barclays\uc2 . "It would be rational to expect a move to the center," says analyst Alejandro Grisanti. Still, he warns that "radicalization and confrontation have been President Chavez's method of \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 (riva.froymovich@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 1635 GMT [Dow Jones] USD/JPY dipped to 84.11, its lowest level since massive Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. Pair currently at 84.15 from 84.28 late Fri, according to EBS via CQG. (bradley.davis@dowjones.com) [ 09-27-10 1351ET ]\par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100927e69r000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
