\par\par \b \uc2 JGBs gain as Nikkei slips despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk\b0\par\par\uc2 478 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 2010\par 02:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  for second time this month\par \par \uc2 * Underlying easing expections support bond market\par \par \uc2 * 10-yr yield falls below 1 pct for first time in 3 weeks\par \par \uc2 By Shinichi Saoshiro\par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Sept 24 (Reuters) - Japanese government bonds rose on Friday, with futures moving back towards a seven-year peak, as Tokyo stocks extended losses despite talk of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which would be \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's second attempt this month to weaken the yen and protect its export-dependent economy, failed to shore up Tokyo stocks and could add to pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ease more.\par \par \uc2 Expectations that the Bank of Japan will ease further had already been turned up a notch earlier this week after the Federal Reserve expressed stronger concerns on Tuesday about low inflation and signalled it was open to future policy loosening.\par \par \uc2 "The situation may not be urgent enough for immediate action, but if the Fed were to ease at the next meeting then that would enhance likelihood of policy loosening by the BOJ," said Akito Fukunaga, chief rates strategist at RBS Securities.\par \par \uc2 If it were to ease, market players expect the BOJ to expand its fixed-rate funding \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  or increase the amount of JGBs it buys from the market.\par \par \uc2 BOJ board member Ryuzo Miyao said on Wednesday increasing JGB purchases was an option, but he added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not have preset ideas about future policy.\par \par \uc2 The benchmark 10-year yield fell 3 basis points to 0.995 percent, falling below 1 percent for the first time in three weeks after meeting stiff resistance from sellers such as regional banks at the threshold.\par \par \uc2 December 10-year futures climbed 0.23 point to 142.88, heading closer to a seven-year high of 143.14 struck in August.\par \par \uc2 The dollar traded at 84.70 yen after going as high as 85.40 yen on trading platform EBS on the talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The impact of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  decreases each time and bond market caution lessens as well," said Koji Ochiai, a senior market economist at Mizuho Investors Securities.\par \par \uc2 The BOJ opting not to absorb from the market the yen it sells for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would add to money market liquidity and is also seen as a form of easing.\par \par \uc2 The five-year yield dipped 0.5 basis point to 0.280 percent and the 20-year yield fell 3.5 basis points to 1.725 percent.\par \par \uc2 The five-year/20-year yield spread tightened to 144.5 basis points, its flattest since the end of August.\par \par \uc2 Tokyo's Nikkei share average fell 1 percent for its third straight day of losses after briefly turning positive on the talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Editing by Michael Watson)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -JGB (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABX|BNX|FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100927e69o0001g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
